	(text "CWD NC; SET1=VDD; WDO and ENOUT wired open drain.\n330..470ms total rail-valid to reset release; WDT 1.36..1.84s.\nFirst DSP falling WDI edge <=1.13s after reset release.\nDSP WDI default low; firmware services during boot."
